<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/1/eng@/~cl_6__para_d> <https://schema.org/text> "by substituting for subsections (4) and (5) the following subsections: \"(4) The Authority may inform the home supervisory authority of any adverse conditions in the offshore financial institution if the Authority is satisfied that Labuan Offshore Financial Services Authority (Amendment) such information is necessary for the supervisory functions of the home supervisory authority. (5) Notwithstanding subsection (2), if the Authority has reasonable suspicion or is satisfied, based on the evidence made available to the Authority, that fraud, a money laundering offence, a terrorism financing offence or any criminal offence has been or is likely to be committed by any offshore financial institution or any corporation related, to the offshore financial institution or any person, the Authority may give information of such commission or likelihood, or convey any or all information in relation to such commission or likelihood to the home supervisory authority or domestic law enforcement agency.\"; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/1/eng@> .
